 "summary": "The PR implements roadmap Layer 1 \u00a71.1 (README.md:405-416) item for item \u2014 `Target` with `M > 0` and spin, the off-forward kinematics `p, p', \u0394, P, t, Q\u00b2`, `P \u00b7 \u0394 = 0`, `t \u2264 0` as a theorem, the Breit-frame relation of `Q\u00b2` to `|\u0394\u20d7|\u00b2` with the boost applied explicitly per Convention 3 (README.md:115), and `ofLiteratureT` with the derivative and integral lemmas. The four supporting files (spatial-part linearity, equal-square Minkowski identities, `Velocity.zero_spatialPart`, the generalised-boost-to-rest lemma) are direct prerequisites of that one file, and the Layer 0 stage it sits above exists on main (`EpsilonEridani/QFT/QCD/EnergyMomentumTensor/{QuarkPart,GluonPart,Total}.lean`); the GPD proof rewrites are the landing of the shared lemmas extracted in this PR, not a second topic, though the description's claim that the GPD module is untouched is inaccurate.",
